Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 08:43:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/49] S020 review (index): the stock listing loop that
 nothing calls moves to the tests

REVIEW-s020 section 7: after S020's listing routes MasterIndex.listPacks
was always called with collect = true and ListPacks no longer called
it, so stock's sixteen-pass loop behind the parameter was unreachable
in the binary. The parameter and the loop are removed from the
production file. The loop lives on unchanged as listPacksStock in a
test file, because the listing tests compare every production path
with it. League batch names are dropped from one test file name and
its helper types.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
